WEBVTT

01:29.330 --> 01:34.390
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.729 --> 01:37.880
[Episode 11]

01:49.539 --> 01:50.400
Just wait!

01:50.430 --> 01:51.080
Wait!

01:53.820 --> 01:54.580
It's fine.

01:56.000 --> 01:58.289
Come on! Come on! Come on!

01:58.320 --> 02:01.100
Come on! Come on! Come on!

02:01.120 --> 02:04.200
Come on! Come on! Come on!

02:04.220 --> 02:07.560
Come on! Come on! Come on!

02:53.230 --> 02:55.540
Come on! Come on! Come on!

02:53.790 --> 02:56.360
[Xiaoyong Team vs. Luohe Team]

02:55.560 --> 02:57.860
Come on! Come on! Come on!

02:57.880 --> 03:00.420
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:00.440 --> 03:02.830
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:02.850 --> 03:05.030
Come on! Come on!

03:14.470 --> 03:17.050
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:17.079 --> 03:20.030
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:20.050 --> 03:22.470
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:21.140 --> 03:22.910
[Xiaoyong Team vs. Luohe Team]

03:22.480 --> 03:26.140
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:53.020 --> 03:54.410
[Xiaoyong Team vs. Luohe Team]

03:59.350 --> 04:01.760
[Xiaoyong Team vs. Luohe Team]

04:38.220 --> 04:40.570
Wan, why are you here?

04:40.720 --> 04:41.630
Did you see Lu Xixiao's

04:41.630 --> 04:42.720
buzzer-beating three-pointer?

04:42.720 --> 04:45.050
It was so cool.
Let me show you the picture.

04:46.470 --> 04:47.600
That's great, Meng.

04:47.800 --> 04:49.630
I'm not feeling very well.

04:49.630 --> 04:50.920
I want to go back first.

04:52.070 --> 04:53.270
What's wrong with you?

04:53.270 --> 04:54.190
Why are you bleeding?

04:54.190 --> 04:56.390
I accidentally bumped into something.

04:56.630 --> 04:57.630
Where did you hurt yourself?

04:57.630 --> 04:59.050
Let me walk you home. Let's go.

04:59.050 --> 05:00.120
I'm really fine.

05:00.140 --> 05:02.400
-Jiang Fan is waiting for you.
-Zhou Wan!

05:05.170 --> 05:06.370
When did you get here?

05:08.430 --> 05:09.110
We won.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.280
That's great.

05:15.150 --> 05:16.120
They're all going out to eat together.

05:16.120 --> 05:16.980
Are you coming?

05:18.240 --> 05:18.990
I...

05:20.310 --> 05:22.430
I have to go to the arcade later.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.600
I'll pass.

05:25.190 --> 05:27.450
How long are you planning to keep hiding?

05:36.770 --> 05:37.970
What happened to you?

05:38.960 --> 05:39.909
I bumped into something.

05:39.909 --> 05:42.110
You don't get hurt like that from a bump.

05:42.200 --> 05:43.730
Who did this to you? Tell me.

05:46.330 --> 05:47.570
It's really nothing.

05:48.300 --> 05:50.270
I asked you who did this. Speak.

05:53.970 --> 05:54.970
Who did this?

06:04.150 --> 06:04.790
Luo He.

06:06.580 --> 06:08.180
Slow down, bro! Watch where you're going!

06:08.180 --> 06:09.210
Watch it!

06:14.200 --> 06:16.200
Lu Xixiao, you got a death wish or what?

06:16.200 --> 06:17.270
Get him!

06:17.680 --> 06:18.140
Get him!

06:19.680 --> 06:20.440
Hit him!

06:20.480 --> 06:21.230
Beat him up!

06:37.920 --> 06:38.560
Can I ask you

06:38.560 --> 06:39.510
why you played basketball

06:39.510 --> 06:40.390
with Luo He?

06:59.040 --> 07:00.040
He didn't fight.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.000
It was that fat guy.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.410
He tackled him as soon as he came over

07:02.410 --> 07:03.340
and hit him.

07:03.430 --> 07:05.220
Yeah, I didn't touch him.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.190
-He started it.
-You were the one

07:06.190 --> 07:06.940
-He hit him first.
-who hit us first!

07:06.940 --> 07:08.040
Who started it?

07:08.040 --> 07:08.870
I saw everything.

07:08.870 --> 07:09.800
I really didn't hit him.

07:09.800 --> 07:11.530
Officer, I really didn't do it.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.340
They started it.

07:17.310 --> 07:17.830
Then what exactly happened

07:17.830 --> 07:19.090
between you and Luo He?

07:28.720 --> 07:30.720
Zhou Wan, you're really something.

07:31.000 --> 07:31.800
Last time I asked you,

07:31.800 --> 07:33.130
you wouldn't say a word.

07:33.140 --> 07:36.420
Now you've been bullied
and you're still not saying anything.

07:36.420 --> 07:37.570
I did.

07:43.930 --> 07:45.730
Then what happened to your head?

07:46.920 --> 07:49.010
I mean, couldn't you have run?

07:49.430 --> 07:50.480
You dodge me quickly enough all the time.

07:50.480 --> 07:52.010
Why couldn't you dodge him?

07:54.400 --> 07:55.610
I twisted my ankle.

07:58.320 --> 07:59.600
He hurt your ankle too?

08:04.470 --> 08:05.670
The police are right here.

08:05.670 --> 08:06.600
-Well...
-Calm down.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.600
Lu Xixiao, right?

08:08.190 --> 08:08.560
All of you, come with me

08:08.560 --> 08:09.750
to the police station.

08:09.750 --> 08:11.070
Don't be so impulsive next time.

08:11.070 --> 08:11.680
When you meet this kind of person,

08:11.680 --> 08:12.740
you should call the police immediately.

08:12.740 --> 08:14.190
That guy played dirty.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.680
I put up with him on the court
for a long time.

08:15.680 --> 08:17.390
He lost the game
and still wanted to cause trouble.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.360
-Fine.
-I think he needs to be punished.

08:18.360 --> 08:19.560
We just got lectured.

08:44.860 --> 08:46.030
Eat more.

08:46.670 --> 08:47.930
Thank you, Uncle Kang.

08:53.580 --> 08:55.460
The atmosphere seems a bit off.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.800
Are you two fighting?

09:00.210 --> 09:00.970
No.

09:03.330 --> 09:05.030
Young man, you are full of vigor

09:05.030 --> 09:06.360
and have quite a temper.

09:07.320 --> 09:08.620
Listen to me,

09:09.180 --> 09:10.120
as a man,

09:10.410 --> 09:11.820
no matter what happens,

09:11.950 --> 09:14.010
you shouldn't treat a girl like that.

09:14.280 --> 09:15.100
You have to be a gentleman.

09:15.100 --> 09:16.310
I treat her very well.

09:22.090 --> 09:23.550
Then it's not good enough.

09:33.550 --> 09:34.150
Lu Xi...

09:36.910 --> 09:42.320
[Welcome]

10:34.600 --> 10:35.460
Let me do it.

10:39.180 --> 10:40.060
Thank you.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.010
Which foot?

11:04.210 --> 11:04.920
I'm fine.

11:07.770 --> 11:08.500
Which ankle?

11:17.300 --> 11:18.100
The right one.

12:23.260 --> 12:25.190
You don't have to avoid me anymore.

12:26.330 --> 12:27.530
Do whatever you want.

12:32.140 --> 12:32.860
Thank you.

12:38.440 --> 12:39.240
Do you think that's

12:39.240 --> 12:40.440
what I wanted to hear?

12:48.240 --> 12:49.770
I won't avoid you anymore.

12:51.670 --> 12:53.070
But there are some things

12:55.200 --> 12:56.660
I don't want to talk about.

12:57.990 --> 13:00.050
Can you promise not to ask?

13:04.270 --> 13:05.150
Please.

13:11.270 --> 13:12.600
So, no more avoiding me?

13:23.390 --> 13:25.110
If this happens again,

13:25.720 --> 13:26.750
tell me immediately.

13:26.750 --> 13:27.840
Don't keep it from me.

13:27.840 --> 13:28.990
You don't need to be afraid of them,

13:28.990 --> 13:29.790
do you hear me?

13:31.670 --> 13:32.930
I'm not afraid of them.

13:33.700 --> 13:35.210
And I don't want to be.

13:50.670 --> 13:52.070
Does your leg still hurt?

13:55.150 --> 13:55.960
Not anymore.

14:04.280 --> 14:07.140
It's injured like this,
and you say it doesn't hurt?

14:10.270 --> 14:10.960
It hurts.

14:12.830 --> 14:14.560
Why are you always so stubborn?

14:19.900 --> 14:20.500
Get on.

14:28.520 --> 14:30.670
[Uncle Kang's Noodle Shop]

14:40.670 --> 14:42.080
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

14:43.350 --> 14:44.910
[Close]

14:43.810 --> 14:45.410
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

14:48.610 --> 14:50.320
♪ I think you would understand ♪

14:52.020 --> 14:54.220
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

14:56.670 --> 14:58.390
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

14:59.360 --> 15:00.270
Which building?

14:59.980 --> 15:02.490
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

15:02.680 --> 15:03.650
That one.

15:03.680 --> 15:06.050
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

15:07.220 --> 15:08.850
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

15:12.530 --> 15:14.170
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

15:14.950 --> 15:15.790
You can stop here.

15:15.790 --> 15:16.800
You can stop here.

15:16.100 --> 15:17.450
♪ An astronomer ♪

15:20.650 --> 15:22.250
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

15:24.020 --> 15:26.570
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

15:27.350 --> 15:28.150
Hold on tight.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.520
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

15:31.960 --> 15:34.270
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

15:33.860 --> 15:35.190
This path is too narrow.

15:35.520 --> 15:36.720
It's probably hard for you to walk, right?

15:35.700 --> 15:38.180
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

15:39.660 --> 15:43.440
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

15:41.290 --> 15:42.520
Just stop here.

15:46.480 --> 15:47.820
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

15:48.630 --> 15:50.010
♪ No time left, so I ♪

15:48.640 --> 15:50.540
Really, stop here.

15:50.560 --> 15:52.640
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

15:54.530 --> 15:57.220
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

15:57.380 --> 16:00.800
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

16:02.680 --> 16:05.210
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

16:05.250 --> 16:08.860
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

16:08.040 --> 16:09.900
Remember to change the dressing.

16:10.650 --> 16:12.140
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

16:12.160 --> 16:14.860
♪ This mud all over me ♪

16:15.600 --> 16:18.710
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

16:20.480 --> 16:21.540
Are you home alone?

16:22.670 --> 16:23.670
Where is Grandma?

16:30.010 --> 16:31.060
I lied to you.

16:32.570 --> 16:34.430
Grandma is still in the hospital.

16:37.930 --> 16:38.760
Lu Xixiao.

16:43.750 --> 16:44.630
Thank you.

17:25.430 --> 17:27.730
♪ A muted gray ♪

17:28.690 --> 17:31.750
♪ Everything looks this way ♪

17:32.970 --> 17:36.210
♪ Another abandoned place ♪

17:33.510 --> 17:34.390
Dad.

17:34.790 --> 17:37.630
Am I being too selfish?

17:37.100 --> 17:39.120
♪ Swallowed by storm ♪

17:38.640 --> 17:40.280
I want to save Grandma.

17:40.680 --> 17:41.940
But I also don't want to

17:42.500 --> 17:44.220
hurt Lu Xixiao again.

17:43.420 --> 17:45.010
♪ Hold my breath ♪

17:46.280 --> 17:47.470
♪ Run away from this mess ♪

17:48.480 --> 17:51.940
♪ Look to the light instead ♪

17:51.740 --> 17:53.150
If I really did something wrong,

17:52.110 --> 17:56.120
♪ It's time to forget ♪

17:54.210 --> 17:56.230
then just punish me alone.

17:57.290 --> 17:59.730
[Loan Agreement]

18:00.740 --> 18:05.010
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

18:05.130 --> 18:06.890
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

18:06.990 --> 18:08.330
♪ In the river ♪

18:08.460 --> 18:10.270
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

18:11.130 --> 18:14.570
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

18:18.080 --> 18:22.120
♪ Somewhere in this cold and bottomless pit ♪

18:22.310 --> 18:24.470
♪ Something lingers ♪

18:24.580 --> 18:26.880
♪ Hiding under a stitch ♪

18:27.080 --> 18:30.480
♪ I thought I lost your remnant ♪

18:30.580 --> 18:32.560
♪ But it's ♪

18:34.430 --> 18:35.940
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

18:34.540 --> 18:35.190
Zhou Wan,

18:36.640 --> 18:37.640
how many secrets

18:37.640 --> 18:38.680
are you still hiding?

18:38.680 --> 18:40.820
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

18:40.310 --> 18:41.070
How many more times are you going

18:41.070 --> 18:42.360
to tear my heart apart?

18:43.120 --> 18:46.710
♪ I feel it stir stir stir ♪

18:45.690 --> 18:49.030
[Actually, I already know.]

18:46.880 --> 18:49.900
♪ I still remember ♪

18:51.740 --> 18:53.720
♪ Shines like a star ♪

18:56.150 --> 18:58.620
♪ Glows like an ember ♪

19:00.550 --> 19:04.300
♪ Float like a curse curse curse ♪

19:04.400 --> 19:08.410
♪ Hurts like a sunburn ♪

19:28.250 --> 19:29.920
I hope you like it.

19:30.430 --> 19:31.960
It's from Miss Zhou.

19:32.490 --> 19:36.860
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

19:37.090 --> 19:38.620
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

19:38.820 --> 19:40.020
♪ In the river ♪

19:40.180 --> 19:42.010
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

19:42.670 --> 19:46.100
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

19:49.760 --> 19:53.650
♪ Stranded in this cold and bottomless pit ♪

19:53.850 --> 19:56.070
♪ Makes me quiver ♪

19:56.190 --> 19:58.600
♪ Crimson spell of a witch ♪

19:58.820 --> 20:02.230
♪ I thought I'm over your magic ♪

20:02.330 --> 20:04.270
♪ But it's ♪

20:05.910 --> 20:07.490
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

20:08.680 --> 20:09.240
Zhou Wan,

20:10.340 --> 20:12.580
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

20:10.480 --> 20:11.510
if you must

20:11.510 --> 20:12.420
do this,

20:13.370 --> 20:14.880
I will play along with you

20:14.500 --> 20:18.470
♪ I feel it stir stir stir ♪

20:15.680 --> 20:17.080
to protect your secrets.

20:18.750 --> 20:21.370
♪ I still remember ♪

20:24.040 --> 20:24.640
Grandma,

20:24.750 --> 20:26.200
I'll pack your things

20:26.200 --> 20:27.520
and bring them to you.

20:27.830 --> 20:29.000
Be good and wait for me at the hospital.

20:29.000 --> 20:29.740
Okay?

21:34.800 --> 21:36.130
What are you doing here?

21:37.310 --> 21:38.580
What are you doing here?

21:38.580 --> 21:39.930
Did you find the wrench?

21:43.920 --> 21:44.980
Why are you here?

21:47.560 --> 21:48.560
It's dying.

21:50.100 --> 21:51.960
You have to take responsibility.

21:55.470 --> 21:57.370
Did you forget to water it?

21:58.850 --> 21:59.960
Lilies need more water

21:59.960 --> 22:00.940
this season.

22:02.270 --> 22:02.830
Wait a second;

22:02.830 --> 22:04.290
I'll write it down for you.

22:04.510 --> 22:05.920
Lilies bloom once a year.

22:05.940 --> 22:07.440
This flower is so wilted.

22:07.460 --> 22:09.390
It will only bloom again next year.

22:10.790 --> 22:11.500
[Loan Agreement]

22:24.350 --> 22:25.690
Cut off the dead flowers

22:25.720 --> 22:26.620
like this,

22:27.680 --> 22:30.610
then fertilize them again
to help the bulbs recover.

22:30.800 --> 22:32.260
I'll write it down for you.

22:35.730 --> 22:36.850
Once the stem turns yellow,

22:36.850 --> 22:37.720
you can reduce watering

22:37.720 --> 22:38.970
or stop watering completely.

22:38.970 --> 22:39.890
When winter comes,

22:39.890 --> 22:41.490
it'll grow new shoots again.

22:47.480 --> 22:49.070
Are you listening to me?

22:51.230 --> 22:52.220
How is your ankle?

22:52.220 --> 22:53.750
Did you apply the medicine?

22:57.830 --> 22:58.550
Yes.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.770
Do you remember what I said?

23:03.680 --> 23:04.530
No.

23:04.550 --> 23:05.610
Say it again.

23:07.770 --> 23:08.580
Forget it.

23:12.310 --> 23:14.370
Just follow what I wrote on the paper.

23:17.480 --> 23:18.490
Zhou Wan,

23:18.790 --> 23:20.250
where is your flashlight?

23:20.850 --> 23:21.570
Coming.

23:27.720 --> 23:28.580
How is it going?

23:29.070 --> 23:29.800
Almost done.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.610
Do you know how to fix it?

23:31.610 --> 23:33.270
If not, let someone else do it.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.350
He can fix it.

23:35.840 --> 23:37.370
How do you know he can fix it?

23:37.880 --> 23:39.370
The pipes in Jiang Yan's house
break a lot too.

23:39.370 --> 23:40.370
So he has

23:40.400 --> 23:41.550
the most complete set of tools.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.880
I can plant flowers too.

23:45.750 --> 23:46.550
So you asked him to come over

23:46.550 --> 23:47.950
just to borrow his tools?

23:52.240 --> 23:53.640
I called a repairman,

23:53.640 --> 23:55.370
but he said he isn't free today.

23:55.750 --> 23:57.210
He can only come tomorrow.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.980
I know your house
better than the repairman.

24:00.980 --> 24:02.780
Just call me directly next time.

24:02.880 --> 24:03.720
Is it fixed?

24:11.140 --> 24:14.030
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

24:15.000 --> 24:16.880
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

24:17.460 --> 24:20.360
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

24:21.870 --> 24:23.510
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

24:25.260 --> 24:28.370
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

24:29.320 --> 24:32.640
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

24:34.540 --> 24:35.940
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

24:35.970 --> 24:37.680
♪ That I can fly ♪

24:39.980 --> 24:40.820
♪ Long time no see ♪

24:40.890 --> 24:42.230
♪ You haven't been here ♪

24:43.340 --> 24:45.770
♪ Stop watch has seen the changes ♪

24:46.520 --> 24:48.460
♪ I'm sure you won't forget ♪

24:48.490 --> 24:50.320
♪ The door you ever knocked ♪

24:52.010 --> 24:54.130
♪ So I sent you a clock ♪

24:54.150 --> 24:55.830
♪ To recover the deadlock ♪

24:57.180 --> 24:59.160
♪ It's like I'm losing my sword ♪

25:00.450 --> 25:03.290
♪ Chop off the line
between the loving core ♪

25:05.970 --> 25:08.520
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

25:07.690 --> 25:08.940
Your clothes are wet.

25:10.050 --> 25:11.600
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

25:10.070 --> 25:11.400
Here, dry yourself off.

25:12.800 --> 25:15.180
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

25:13.750 --> 25:15.420
The pipes in our building are too old.

25:15.420 --> 25:16.670
Some of them are rusted,

25:16.670 --> 25:18.000
probably causing deformation.

25:16.940 --> 25:18.570
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

25:19.690 --> 25:22.940
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

25:22.470 --> 25:23.400
Let me try.

25:24.230 --> 25:27.320
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

25:29.570 --> 25:31.660
♪ Nescience doesn't mean that I can fly ♪

25:35.270 --> 25:37.150
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

25:37.220 --> 25:39.180
♪ The dormer lock ♪

25:42.080 --> 25:44.400
♪ Tell you starts were above the floor ♪

25:49.560 --> 25:50.860
It's not the pipe.

25:51.540 --> 25:53.600
It's the joint at the shut-off valve.

25:54.040 --> 25:55.950
Water doesn't care who comes first.

25:55.950 --> 25:58.080
It just goes wherever it wants to flow.

26:01.590 --> 26:02.830
It's really fixed.

26:03.510 --> 26:05.240
You're soaked.

26:05.580 --> 26:07.760
You should change your clothes.

26:08.900 --> 26:11.160
You've got clothes for me to change into?

26:12.090 --> 26:13.300
I'll get you one.

26:17.240 --> 26:18.620
Then let me treat you to lunch.

26:18.620 --> 26:19.480
I'll cook

26:20.110 --> 26:21.640
to thank you both properly.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.700
We're eating here?

26:27.770 --> 26:28.900
Let's go to my place.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.000
When we come back this afternoon,

26:30.000 --> 26:31.260
I'll help you clean up.

26:36.070 --> 26:37.350
Is there any food left in your fridge?

26:37.350 --> 26:38.480
Should I go buy some?

26:38.590 --> 26:40.120
Yes, use whatever you want.

26:43.830 --> 26:45.240
What are you going to make later?

26:45.240 --> 26:46.200
Braised chicken wings?

26:46.200 --> 26:47.200
Kung pao chicken?

26:47.680 --> 26:49.540
I'll make whatever is available.

26:51.880 --> 26:52.560
Wait for me.

27:05.100 --> 27:05.900
Wear this.

27:06.100 --> 27:06.630
It's new.

27:07.030 --> 27:08.430
You can change in my room.

27:48.030 --> 27:50.090
That's a photo of us when we were kids.

27:54.470 --> 27:56.070
I'll return one to you later.

27:56.670 --> 27:57.430
No need.

27:59.370 --> 28:01.500
I never thought I'd come to your house.

28:03.800 --> 28:05.200
I only did it for Zhou Wan.

28:05.970 --> 28:07.100
If you stay this wet,

28:07.280 --> 28:08.540
she'll blame herself.

28:09.500 --> 28:11.230
You really care about Zhou Wan.

28:14.450 --> 28:15.380
You like her?

28:20.030 --> 28:21.830
Lu Xixiao, do you eat spicy food?

28:27.090 --> 28:28.750
You two didn't argue, did you?

28:30.640 --> 28:31.400
No.

28:35.180 --> 28:36.780
Then you guys keep chatting.

28:37.100 --> 28:37.650
We...

28:54.920 --> 28:56.520
Why do you keep looking at me?

28:57.440 --> 28:58.500
Nothing, it's just

28:59.480 --> 29:00.550
you look different

29:00.550 --> 29:01.880
in this outfit.

29:02.950 --> 29:04.410
You look so well-behaved.

29:09.830 --> 29:10.480
And this dish

29:10.480 --> 29:13.080
doesn't really taste like
something you made.

29:13.530 --> 29:15.530
If you want to praise me, just say it.

29:18.940 --> 29:19.870
It's delicious.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.800
Eat some more.

29:22.290 --> 29:23.330
I can help myself.

29:28.330 --> 29:29.270
Wan is here.

29:29.710 --> 29:30.430
Auntie.

29:32.340 --> 29:33.900
Mom, why are you back?

29:35.750 --> 29:36.790
I'm not feeling well today.

29:36.790 --> 29:37.790
So I took time off.

29:37.830 --> 29:39.160
Your classmate is here.

29:41.930 --> 29:43.060
Why are you here?

29:46.930 --> 29:47.620
Jiang Yan!

29:48.440 --> 29:49.530
What is going on?

29:53.960 --> 29:54.700
Auntie,

29:55.310 --> 29:56.770
my water pipe broke today.

29:57.130 --> 29:58.850
Lu Xixiao is our classmate.

29:58.880 --> 30:00.280
They both came to help me.

30:02.050 --> 30:03.850
Jiang Yan, ask him to leave.

30:04.350 --> 30:05.610
I don't want to see him.

30:05.670 --> 30:07.930
There are no good people in the Lu family.

30:12.240 --> 30:13.570
I won't come here again.

30:15.170 --> 30:17.600
Auntie, I will leave first too.

30:32.330 --> 30:32.960
Zhou Wan,

30:37.010 --> 30:38.670
do you have anything to ask me?

30:47.160 --> 30:48.030
So,

30:50.200 --> 30:52.350
you know everything.

30:54.770 --> 30:56.720
Last time when it was Jiang Yan's
birthday,

30:56.720 --> 30:58.610
I saw him get into Mr. Lu's car.

30:59.810 --> 31:00.570
Jiang Yan!

31:06.700 --> 31:08.900
I just came back from dinner with my dad.

31:12.200 --> 31:13.210
I'm sorry.

31:14.620 --> 31:15.780
If it weren't for me,

31:16.640 --> 31:18.640
that wouldn't have happened.

31:22.330 --> 31:25.130
There are so many people
I should blame myself for.

31:27.460 --> 31:28.720
You are not one of them.

31:30.470 --> 31:31.990
You bought so much.

31:32.080 --> 31:33.380
I didn't expect our Xixiao

31:33.380 --> 31:34.780
to like painting so much.

31:55.590 --> 31:56.590
Is it ridiculous?

31:58.810 --> 32:00.870
Jiang Yan is half a year older than me.

32:03.630 --> 32:05.340
Did you fight in school

32:06.060 --> 32:08.240
because of this?

32:08.940 --> 32:09.940
Not entirely.

32:12.810 --> 32:13.740
I'm leaving now.

32:13.940 --> 32:14.760
Lu Xixiao,

32:18.290 --> 32:19.420
don't let the past

32:19.450 --> 32:20.710
affect who you are now.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.950
Are you worried about me?

32:32.260 --> 32:33.520
I am worried about you.

32:40.300 --> 32:42.230
You should do that yourself first.

32:46.770 --> 32:47.370
By the way,

32:48.920 --> 32:49.570
my flower.

32:58.910 --> 33:00.640
You need to take good care of it.

33:01.480 --> 33:03.340
How about I plant it at your place?

33:03.700 --> 33:05.360
I feel like it'll live longer.

33:09.840 --> 33:10.640
I knew it.

33:27.280 --> 33:30.920
[Certificate]

33:50.160 --> 33:51.670
[Loan Agreement]

34:07.070 --> 34:07.960
[Loan Agreement]

34:08.230 --> 34:10.590
[Loan Agreement]

34:13.290 --> 34:16.280
[Lender (Individual): Luo He]

34:38.389 --> 34:40.050
Are you going to the hospital?

34:41.100 --> 34:42.500
I'm going to see Grandma.

34:46.400 --> 34:48.480
Why did Luo He look for you that day?

34:49.230 --> 34:51.020
Aren't all thugs like that?

34:51.409 --> 34:52.590
They'll act up

34:52.590 --> 34:54.050
over the slightest thing.

34:56.780 --> 34:58.640
I mean after the basketball game—

34:59.110 --> 35:00.640
did he give you any trouble?

35:06.980 --> 35:07.580
No.

35:08.800 --> 35:10.590
He doesn't even come to
collect rent himself.

35:10.590 --> 35:12.400
His men usually handle it.

35:25.360 --> 35:25.990
Zhou Wan,

35:26.960 --> 35:29.440
have you been short of money recently?

35:32.870 --> 35:34.040
I've solved it all.

35:36.560 --> 35:38.490
Let's go. I'm going to see Grandma.

35:41.500 --> 35:42.430
I'll go with you.

35:49.130 --> 35:51.550
There are thousands of people
in your school.

35:51.550 --> 35:52.480
Do you have to get involved

35:52.480 --> 35:53.550
with the Lu family?

35:55.850 --> 35:57.850
I won't associate with him anymore.

35:58.950 --> 36:00.340
Don't forget

36:01.550 --> 36:02.480
how much their family

36:02.480 --> 36:04.010
looked down on us back then.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.040
Zhongyue promised me

36:15.040 --> 36:16.170
not to see you again.

36:16.450 --> 36:17.510
Respect yourself.

36:19.090 --> 36:21.860
From now on, Yan and I

36:21.930 --> 36:24.190
will never step into the Lu family again.

36:27.990 --> 36:29.190
I haven't forgotten.

36:32.370 --> 36:33.970
Good. As long as you haven't.

36:34.520 --> 36:35.830
Zhou Wan is Zhou Wan.

36:36.320 --> 36:37.710
If she chooses to cling to the Lu family,

36:37.710 --> 36:38.960
that's her choice.

36:40.950 --> 36:42.880
Zhou Wan is not that kind of person.

36:43.290 --> 36:45.190
Or let me put it another way.

36:45.520 --> 36:46.800
Do you think getting into
Huaqing University

36:46.800 --> 36:48.900
means you don't have to
work hard anymore?

36:48.900 --> 36:50.770
If you just stop here,

36:51.600 --> 36:52.330
between you

36:52.580 --> 36:54.760
and the wealth of the Lu family,

36:55.030 --> 36:56.830
who do you think she will choose?

37:01.650 --> 37:03.170
Just drop me off here.

37:03.810 --> 37:05.140
I'll take the things in.

37:06.210 --> 37:07.740
I don't want to trouble you.

37:07.880 --> 37:09.110
There's no time like the present.

37:09.110 --> 37:11.040
It's a good chance to meet Grandma.

37:14.330 --> 37:15.910
But my outfit today

37:16.440 --> 37:17.370
is not my style.

37:19.300 --> 37:20.110
She might mistakenly think

37:20.110 --> 37:21.280
you are a good boy.

37:23.210 --> 37:24.710
I am a good boy.

37:26.230 --> 37:26.830
Alright.

37:29.950 --> 37:30.840
Grandma.

37:31.250 --> 37:32.450
When did you get here?

37:32.470 --> 37:33.240
Grandma.

37:34.730 --> 37:36.010
Who is this?

37:36.910 --> 37:37.670
Lu Xixiao.

37:39.120 --> 37:41.440
He brought you soup before.

37:41.630 --> 37:43.740
He's my friend.

37:45.550 --> 37:46.960
So it's you.

37:47.960 --> 37:48.760
That's great.

37:48.770 --> 37:50.340
Come, please come in.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.280
Today I also brought

37:51.280 --> 37:52.310
some soup for you.

37:52.340 --> 37:52.940
Thank you.

37:53.560 --> 37:54.360
With you here,

37:54.360 --> 37:55.680
it's a bit more lively.

37:56.920 --> 37:58.250
Please sit.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.860
These are the flowers he brought you.

38:01.230 --> 38:02.250
Thank you so much.

38:03.060 --> 38:03.710
Come, sit.

38:08.200 --> 38:10.330
Huang Xuefen, pay and get your medicine.

38:10.330 --> 38:10.850
Okay.

38:12.380 --> 38:14.440
It's time to get the medicine, right?

38:14.890 --> 38:15.850
I'll go later.

38:17.240 --> 38:17.800
What?

38:18.130 --> 38:19.790
You don't trust me being here?

38:20.730 --> 38:21.840
Or are you afraid that if I stay too long,

38:21.840 --> 38:22.980
Grandma will like me more

38:22.980 --> 38:24.040
and won't like you?

38:26.280 --> 38:26.830
Lu Xixiao.

38:26.830 --> 38:27.580
Exactly.

38:27.850 --> 38:29.580
You go ahead, we'll chat.

38:30.920 --> 38:31.510
Okay.

38:31.690 --> 38:32.310
Go.

38:32.350 --> 38:33.510
I'll be back in a bit.

38:33.960 --> 38:34.650
Just stay in the hospital.

38:34.650 --> 38:36.650
You are not going anywhere else. Go.

38:46.030 --> 38:47.060
What's wrong, Grandma?

38:47.060 --> 38:48.350
Nothing.

38:49.150 --> 38:50.620
It's just the illness.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.890
It's inevitable to
have some pain sometimes.

38:52.890 --> 38:54.490
It will be fine after a while.

38:55.590 --> 38:56.610
Sit.

38:56.630 --> 38:58.480
It will be fine after a while.

39:01.220 --> 39:03.610
Well, Lu...

39:03.640 --> 39:04.500
Xixiao.

39:04.930 --> 39:06.290
You can call me Xixiao.

39:06.680 --> 39:07.200
Okay.

39:08.360 --> 39:09.330
Xixiao,

39:09.740 --> 39:10.840
even though it's our

39:10.840 --> 39:12.030
first time meeting,

39:12.230 --> 39:14.420
I have a favor to ask.

39:17.440 --> 39:18.240
Go ahead.

39:18.660 --> 39:19.680
Wan...

39:20.410 --> 39:23.150
Besides Jiang Yan,

39:23.550 --> 39:25.280
she doesn't have many friends.

39:25.920 --> 39:27.820
But I can tell

39:28.040 --> 39:30.650
she treats you differently.

39:32.800 --> 39:33.720
So,

39:34.470 --> 39:36.820
I hope you can do me a favor

39:36.990 --> 39:40.430
and take her out more often.

39:41.540 --> 39:43.400
She is too filial.

39:43.910 --> 39:46.170
She comes to the hospital every day.

39:46.710 --> 39:49.680
Eighteen is such a wonderful age.

39:49.850 --> 39:51.730
It passes in the blink of an eye.

39:52.440 --> 39:53.440
I don't want

39:53.440 --> 39:55.000
her to waste it like this.

39:56.110 --> 39:57.630
So I'm begging you,

39:58.630 --> 39:59.610
talk to her

40:00.180 --> 40:02.790
and take her out more often.

40:06.510 --> 40:07.110
Okay.

40:09.930 --> 40:11.220
Thank you.

40:18.780 --> 40:19.640
Grandma Huang.

40:20.270 --> 40:21.200
You have a guest?

40:21.590 --> 40:23.350
He's quite handsome.

40:23.630 --> 40:24.400
Please step aside.

40:24.400 --> 40:25.800
We need to check the ward.

40:26.110 --> 40:27.150
Sit for a while.

40:33.080 --> 40:33.940
Grandma Huang,

40:34.210 --> 40:36.540
your situation is quite complicated now.

40:37.030 --> 40:38.230
Our specialists

40:38.230 --> 40:39.420
just had a consultation.

40:39.420 --> 40:40.070
We think

40:40.070 --> 40:41.400
the best treatment plan

40:41.430 --> 40:42.760
is a kidney transplant.

40:44.850 --> 40:46.050
A kidney transplant?

40:48.000 --> 40:48.930
Is it expensive?

40:50.250 --> 40:51.850
It's a considerable amount.

40:53.000 --> 40:54.510
How much exactly?

40:55.960 --> 40:56.920
Around 300,000.

40:58.740 --> 41:00.050
300,000?

41:06.130 --> 41:07.290
Can we not do it?

41:11.890 --> 41:13.960
Here, see for yourself.

41:17.630 --> 41:18.760
It's better to do it.

41:47.080 --> 41:47.610
Doctor.

41:49.200 --> 41:50.600
What's wrong, young man?

41:50.830 --> 41:55.230
[Please keep quiet.]

41:52.080 --> 41:53.980
How is

41:54.010 --> 41:55.740
Zhou Wan's grandmother doing?

41:55.890 --> 41:56.720
Don't worry.

41:57.110 --> 41:57.840
If she can

41:57.840 --> 41:58.970
have the surgery,

41:58.990 --> 42:01.120
there's a good chance she'll recover.

42:01.550 --> 42:02.950
When will the surgery be?

42:03.710 --> 42:05.150
It depends on when her family

42:05.150 --> 42:06.880
can gather enough money for it.

42:08.780 --> 42:10.180
I heard Zhou Wan say earlier

42:10.180 --> 42:12.420
she was asking her mom
for the rest of the money.

42:12.420 --> 42:13.950
Zhou Wan is Guo Xiangling's

42:13.970 --> 42:15.150
biological daughter.

42:15.150 --> 42:15.630
God knows

42:15.630 --> 42:16.230
what kind of shady deal

42:16.230 --> 42:17.760
she has with Guo Xiangling.

42:22.090 --> 42:23.060
Why are you here?

42:27.160 --> 42:27.920
[Loan Agreement]

42:28.300 --> 42:29.270
[Lender (Individual): Luo He]

42:28.850 --> 42:30.960
Are you really short of money lately?

42:31.180 --> 42:32.240
I've solved it all.

42:34.380 --> 42:36.210
I've said all that needed to be said.

42:36.210 --> 42:38.380
Can you promise me not to ask?

42:42.920 --> 42:44.590
I did something very bad.

42:45.140 --> 42:46.380
I regret it.

42:46.990 --> 42:49.050
But it seems there is no turning back.

42:51.010 --> 42:51.870
Guo Xiangling.

42:52.350 --> 42:54.450
It turns out
everything was because of you.
